:{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.4 beta 3\n\n### System information\n\nWindows10 - Godot v4.4 beta3\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen calling a method with more than two overloaded versions and a vararg parameter, the correct parameter type cannot be recognized, as demonstrated below:\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n```kotlin\nclass TestClass {\n    companion object {\n        @JvmStatic\n        fun testMethod(int: Int,array: IntArray): String {\n            return \"IntArray\"\n        }\n\n        @JvmStatic\n        fun testMethod(int: Int,vararg args: String): String {\n            return \"StringArray\"\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\nWhen I call this class in Godot, it fails to recognize the parameter types correctly, causing the wrong method to be invoked every time.\n\n```gdscript\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar javaClass = JavaClassWrapper.wrap(\"com.godot.game.TestClass\")\n\tprint('from kotlin:' + javaClass.testMethod(1,[\"asd\"]))\n```\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2c4071e5-76ea-4285-8d88-de0cc5751260)\nWhen I pass a parameter of type String, the first method is invoked instead of the second method with the vararg parameter.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102712/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102712/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}